<title>POLAND: EXBUD TO ASSIMILATE 2.0 MLN RIGHTS NOV 28.</title>
<headline>EXBUD TO ASSIMILATE 2.0 MLN RIGHTS NOV 28.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two million shares of Polish construction company Exbud SA September rights issue will be assimilated with the shares currently traded on the bourse on November 28, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Exbud currently has eight million shares traded on the Warsaw Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
